<concept id="t00501">
	<title>Blind-Spot Collision-Avoidance Assist operation</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>Blind-Spot Collision-Avoidance Assist will warn and control as following operation.</p>
		<ul id="e03799">
			<li>
				<p>Collision warning</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Collision-avoidance assist (while departing)</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
